### 1️⃣ Register user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Docker User",
  "email": "docker@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 2️⃣ Login - COPY THE TOKEN FROM RESPONSE
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "docker@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 3️⃣ Create product (replace TOKEN)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJkb2NrZXJAZXhhbXBsZS5jb20iLCJyb2xlIjoiUk9MRV9VU0VSIiwiaWF0IjoxNzgwNTcxMDU3LCJleHAiOjE3ODA2NTc0NTd9.Yi3vV_ItUM24qfK2uc1xtkxGEaXDUJaJTmqaWRxd1g8
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "MacBook Pro",
  "description": "Apple Laptop",
  "price": 149999.00,
  "stock": 50,
  "category": "Electronics"
}

###

### 4️⃣ Get all products (replace TOKEN)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJkb2NrZXJAZXhhbXBsZS5jb20iLCJyb2xlIjoiUk9MRV9VU0VSIiwiaWF0IjoxNzgwNTcxMDU3LCJleHAiOjE3ODA2NTc0NTd9.Yi3vV_ItUM24qfK2uc1xtkxGEaXDUJaJTmqaWRxd1g8

