### 5️⃣ Place order (replace TOKEN)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJkb2NrZXJAZXhhbXBsZS5jb20iLCJyb2xlIjoiUk9MRV9VU0VSIiwiaWF0IjoxNzgwNTcxMDU3LCJleHAiOjE3ODA2NTc0NTd9.Yi3vV_ItUM24qfK2uc1xtkxGEaXDUJaJTmqaWRxd1g8
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userEmail": "docker@example.com",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "productName": "MacBook Pro",
      "quantity": 1,
      "price": 149999.00
    }
  ]
}

###

